WEBVTT

02:10:52.792 --> 02:10:54.292
I think it's on 25th…

02:10:54.417 --> 02:10:55.917
Enough of your English!
I'll break your jaw!

02:10:56.209 --> 02:10:57.125
What day was it?

02:10:57.500 --> 02:11:00.709
-Friday or Saturday… It was the…
-Twenty…

02:11:00.834 --> 02:11:02.875
-It was the 24th.
-Saturday!
